@startuml
title CR-DSS - Credit Evaluation Flow v1.0

actor User
participant "CLI (main.py)" as CLI
participant CreditEvaluationService
participant AnnuityCalculator
participant ScoringService

User -> CLI : Enter applicant & loan data
CLI -> CreditEvaluationService : evaluate_credit(applicant, loan)

CreditEvaluationService -> AnnuityCalculator : calculate_annuity(loan)
AnnuityCalculator --> CreditEvaluationService : annuity

CreditEvaluationService -> ScoringService : calculate_score(applicant, loan, annuity)
ScoringService --> CreditEvaluationService : ScoreResult

CreditEvaluationService --> CLI : ScoreResult
CLI --> User : Display result

@enduml
